    content: `
      <p>Not everyone wants to type out a task description. Maybe you're driving, maybe you're in a hurry, or maybe typing just isn't your thing. That's why we built <strong>voice task posting</strong>.</p>
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Go to <a href="/tasks/new">Post a Task</a> and find the "Voice Note" section</li>
